  <!-- ══ HERO ══ -->
  <section class="of-hero re-hero">
    <div
      class="of-hero__bg"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Philadelphia retail storefront with window film installed"
      style="background-image: url('/images/re-hero.jpg')"
    ></div>
    <div class="of-hero__overlay"></div>

    <div class="of-hero__content">

      <div class="of-hero__eyebrow">
        <span>Retail Window Film</span>
        <span class="of-hero__eyebrow-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>Philadelphia</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="of-hero__title">Retail Window Film Philadelphia: Stop Fading, Cut Heat.</h1>

      <p class="of-hero__animated-line">
        Window film built for Philadelphia
        <FlipWords
          words={["boutiques", "clothing stores", "jewelry stores", "specialty shops", "mall storefronts"]}
          staticText=""
          class="of-hero__flip"
        />
      </p>

      <p class="of-hero__subtitle">
        Block 99% of UV rays, reduce solar heat gain, and protect your merchandise and your customers — without sacrificing the views that drive foot traffic.
      </p>

      <div class="of-hero__cta">
        <a href="/contact/" class="of-hero__btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
        <a href="#problem" class="of-hero__btn-secondary">See How It Works</a>
      </div>

      <div class="of-hero__stats-panel" aria-label="Key statistics">
        <div class="of-hero__stats-inner">
          <div class="of-hero__stat">
            <span class="of-hero__stat-number">99%</span>
            <span class="of-hero__stat-label">UV Rays Blocked</span>
          </div>
          <div class="of-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="of-hero__stat">
            <span class="of-hero__stat-number">Up to 30%</span>
            <span class="of-hero__stat-label">Less Solar Heat Gain</span>
          </div>
          <div class="of-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="of-hero__stat">
            <span class="of-hero__stat-number">3M</span>
            <span class="of-hero__stat-label">Certified Dealer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="of-hero__stat-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="of-hero__stat">
            <span class="of-hero__stat-number">2008</span>
            <span class="of-hero__stat-label">Serving Philadelphia Retailers Since</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="swt-body">

    <!-- ══ TRUST BAR ══ -->
    <section class="swt-trust">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="swt-trust__label">Trusted by Philadelphia retailers</p>
        <BrandLogos />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ WHAT IS RETAIL WINDOW FILM ══ -->
    <section class="of-whatis">
      <div class="of-whatis__container">
        <div class="of-whatis__content">
          <span class="of-whatis__eyebrow">What Is Retail Window Film?</span>
          <h2 class="of-whatis__title">The Invisible Layer Between Your Merchandise and the Elements</h2>
          <p class="of-whatis__body">Retail window film is a thin, optically clear or lightly tinted polyester layer applied directly to the interior of your storefront glass. It works silently — blocking UV radiation, absorbing solar heat, and (for security grades) reinforcing glass against impact — without changing the look of your display windows or requiring any structural modification.</p>
          <p class="of-whatis__body">Philadelphia retailers face a unique challenge: the city's east-facing and south-facing storefronts absorb intense morning and afternoon sun, while historic building facades can't always accommodate exterior shading. Retail window film for Philadelphia storefronts is the solution that fits inside the existing architecture and gets to work from day one.</p>
          <div class="of-whatis__stats">
            <div class="of-whatis__stat"><strong>99%</strong><span>UV-A and UV-B blocked</span></div>
            <div class="of-whatis__stat-div"></div>
            <div class="of-whatis__stat"><strong>Up to 79%</strong><span>Solar heat gain reduced</span></div>
            <div class="of-whatis__stat-div"></div>
            <div class="of-whatis__stat"><strong>Clear</strong><span>Tinted, frosted, or mirrored</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="of-whatis__image-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/re-whatis.jpg"
            alt="Retail window film being applied to a Philadelphia storefront glass"
            class="of-whatis__image"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ THE PROBLEM ══ -->
    <section class="of-why" id="problem">
      <div class="of-why__container">

        <!-- Left: image + floating stat card -->
        <div class="of-why__image-wrap">
          <img
            src="/images/re-why.jpg"
            alt="Sunlight streaming through unprotected Philadelphia retail storefront windows"
            class="of-why__image"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="of-why__stat-card">
            <div class="of-why__stat-item">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>99% UV blocked — protects merchandise daily</span>
            </div>
            <div class="of-why__stat-divider"></div>
            <div class="of-why__stat-item">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
              <span>Security film slows smash-and-grab entry</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: content -->
        <div class="of-why__content">
          <div class="of-why__eyebrow">The Problem</div>
          <h2 class="of-why__headline">Philadelphia Storefronts Are Working Against Your Business</h2>
          <p class="of-why__intro">Philadelphia's mixed climate — brutal summer sun, glare off the Schuylkill and Delaware, and icy winters — puts enormous stress on glass-heavy retail spaces. Your windows are your biggest marketing asset and your biggest liability.</p>
          <ul class="of-why__bullets">
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Merchandise Fading</strong> — UV radiation from even cloudy-day light causes irreversible color shift in fabrics, leather, artwork, and branded packaging. Damage accumulates daily, invisibly.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Heat Buildup at Display Windows</strong> — Storefronts facing east or south can create hot zones near displays, making customers uncomfortable and damaging heat-sensitive products like candles, chocolate, and cosmetics.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Glare on POS Terminals &amp; Screens</strong> — Direct sun creates glare that disrupts checkout and makes digital signage unreadable, slowing service and frustrating customers.</span>
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <span><strong>Smash-and-Grab Vulnerability</strong> — Standard retail glass shatters instantly on impact. For jewelers, boutiques, and electronics retailers, a single break-in can cost tens of thousands in merchandise and repairs.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/contact/" class="of-why__cta">
            Get a free retail assessment
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12h15m0 0l-6.75-6.75M19.5 12l-6.75 6.75"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ BENTO BAND ══ -->
    <section class="of-bento">
      <div class="of-bento__header">
        <h2 class="of-bento__title">Philadelphia Retailers Have the Same Problems. Window Film Fixes All of Them.</h2>
        <p class="of-bento__sub">One installation. Multiple results. No renovation required.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="of-bento__compact">

        <div class="of-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="9" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M14 7v2M14 19v2M7 14h2M19 14h2" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="14" cy="14" r="3" fill="#7CB342" fill-opacity="0.15" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1"/>
          </svg>
