          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="of-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="5" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M9 23h10M14 19v4" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M8 11h12M8 14h8" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="of-bento-item__title">Up to 79%</h3>
            <p class="of-bento-item__text">reduction in solar heat gain through storefront glass</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="of-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 3L5 8v7c0 5 4 9 9 10 5-1 9-5 9-10V8L14 3z" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M10 14l3 3 5-5" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="of-bento-item__title">47</h3>
            <p class="of-bento-item__text">verified 5-star reviews from Philadelphia retail clients</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="of-bento-item">
          <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 4c-1.5 4-5 6-9 6 0 7 4 12 9 14 5-2 9-7 9-14-4 0-7.5-2-9-6z" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M10 14l3 3 5-6" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.5"/>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="of-bento-item__title">15+</h3>
            <p class="of-bento-item__text">years of window film installed in Philadelphia retail spaces</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ RETAIL SPACE TYPE GRID ══ -->
    <section class="of-spaces">
      <div class="of-spaces__container">

        <div class="of-spaces__header">
          <div class="of-spaces__eyebrow">Who We Serve</div>
          <h2 class="of-spaces__headline">Window Film for Every Type of Philadelphia Retailer</h2>
          <p class="of-spaces__sub">Different stores have different needs. Here's how we approach each category of retail client.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="of-spaces__grid">

          <!-- Card 1: Boutiques & Clothing Stores — hero -->
          <div class="of-space-card of-space-card--hero">
            <div class="of-space-card__hero-icon">
              <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="4" y="10" width="36" height="24" rx="2" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M4 18h36M14 10v24M30 10v24" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.5"/>
                <circle cx="22" cy="22" r="3" fill="rgba(124,179,66,0.15)" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="of-space-card__hero-title">Boutiques &amp; Clothing Stores</h3>
            <p class="of-space-card__hero-text">Protect garments, accessories, and displays from UV fading. Keep fitting rooms comfortable year-round.</p>
            <div class="of-space-card__pill">UV Protection + Solar Control</div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2: Jewelry & Luxury Retailers — photo -->
          <div class="of-space-card of-space-card--photo">
            <img
              src="/images/re-type-jewelry.jpg"
              alt="Upscale jewelry store interior Philadelphia with security window film on display cases"
              width="400" height="480"
              loading="lazy"
              class="of-space-card__img"
            />
            <div class="of-space-card__photo-overlay"></div>
            <div class="of-space-card__photo-content">
              <h3 class="of-space-card__photo-title">Jewelry &amp; Luxury Retailers</h3>
              <p class="of-space-card__photo-text">Security film reinforces display case glass and storefront windows against smash-and-grab attempts, while UV film preserves the appearance of gemstones and precious metals.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3: Mall & Strip Center Storefronts — photo -->
          <div class="of-space-card of-space-card--photo">
            <img
              src="/images/re-type-mall.jpg"
              alt="Modern mall storefront with large glass facade and decorative window film Philadelphia area"
              width="400" height="480"
              loading="lazy"
              class="of-space-card__img"
            />
            <div class="of-space-card__photo-overlay"></div>
            <div class="of-space-card__photo-content">
              <h3 class="of-space-card__photo-title">Mall &amp; Strip Center Storefronts</h3>
              <p class="of-space-card__photo-text">Uniform solar control across large glass facades reduces HVAC load, improves customer dwell time, and meets energy compliance standards for commercial leases.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4: Specialty Retail & Pop-Ups — dark accent -->
          <div class="of-space-card of-space-card--dark">
            <div class="of-space-card__accent-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="of-space-card__icon-row">
              <svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 34 34" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 28V12l12-7 12 7v16" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <rect x="12" y="18" width="10" height="10" rx="1" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <path d="M17 18v10" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="1.5" opacity="0.4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="of-space-card__dark-title">Specialty Retail, Galleries &amp; Pop-Ups</h3>
            <p class="of-space-card__dark-text">From art galleries in Old City to specialty food stores in Reading Terminal — decorative and UV films protect unique inventory while creating a polished branded aesthetic.</p>
            <div class="of-space-card__micro-pill">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l3 6.5L22 9l-5 5 1.18 7L12 18l-6.18 3L7 14 2 9l7-.5L12 2z" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              Decorative + UV Protection
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ══ BENEFIT ROWS ══ -->
    <section class="of-benefits">
      <div class="of-benefits__container">

        <div class="of-benefits__header">
          <div class="of-benefits__eyebrow">The Benefits</div>
          <h2 class="of-benefits__headline">Four Ways Film Protects Your Philadelphia Storefront</h2>
          <p class="of-benefits__intro">UV protection, energy savings, glare reduction, and security — tackled in a single professional installation. No window replacement, no renovation, no downtime.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 1: UV Protection — image LEFT, text RIGHT -->
        <div class="of-row">
          <div class="of-row__image">
            <img
              src="/images/re-uv.jpg"
              alt="UV protection window film on Philadelphia retail store display windows"
              width="680" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="of-row__text">
            <div class="of-row__eyebrow">Benefit 01</div>
            <h3 class="of-row__title">Stop UV Rays Before They Fade Your Merchandise</h3>
            <p class="of-row__body">UV radiation is the leading cause of merchandise fading — and it comes right through standard glass. Fabrics lose their color. Leather cracks and discolors. Artworks and branded packaging fade unevenly. With <a href="/benefits/uv-blocking-window-film-philadelphia/" style="color: #2E7D32; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #4CAF50; text-underline-offset: 3px;">UV-blocking window film</a> applied to your storefront glass, up to 99% of UV-A and UV-B radiation is blocked before it ever reaches your shelving.</p>
            <p class="of-row__body">For Philadelphia retailers in historic buildings with large single-pane windows — particularly along Walnut Street, South Street, and East Passyunk — UV protection pays for itself by extending the saleable life of displayed inventory and reducing the frequency of window-display rotations. The <a href="https://www.epa.gov/sunsafety/uv-index-scale-1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #2E7D32; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #4CAF50; text-underline-offset: 3px;">EPA notes</a> that UV exposure causes cumulative damage even on overcast days — making year-round protection essential, not just a summer consideration.</p>
            <ul class="of-row__bullets">
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                99% UV-A and UV-B rejection · No visible color change to storefront
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Protects fabrics, leather, artwork, and packaging
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 2: Energy Savings — text LEFT, image RIGHT -->
        <div class="of-row of-row--rev">
          <div class="of-row__image">
            <img
              src="/images/re-energy.jpg"
              alt="Energy-efficient window film on Philadelphia retail storefront reducing cooling costs"
              width="680" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="of-row__text">
            <div class="of-row__eyebrow">Benefit 02</div>
            <h3 class="of-row__title">Reduce the Solar Heat That's Running Up Your Energy Bills</h3>
            <p class="of-row__body">Philadelphia retail storefronts — particularly those with south- or east-facing display windows — absorb intense solar heat that standard glass does nothing to stop. That heat loads your HVAC system hardest on the exact days customers are most likely to cut their visit short. <a href="/benefits/energy-savings/" style="color: #2E7D32; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #4CAF50; text-underline-offset: 3px;">Energy-saving window film</a> intercepts solar radiation at the glass, before it converts to heat inside your store — reducing the thermal load your air conditioning has to fight all summer.</p>
            <p class="of-row__body">For retailers in older Philly buildings with single-pane glass — Walnut Street rowfronts, East Passyunk storefronts, Old City brick facades — the impact is especially noticeable. Thinner, older glass transfers heat aggressively. Retrofit window film is the lowest-disruption upgrade available: no construction, no permits, no landlord negotiation beyond a quick approval, and the thermal benefit starts the same day it's installed.</p>
            <ul class="of-row__bullets">
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Up to 79% solar heat reduction · Lower HVAC demand during peak summer months
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                DOE-recognized energy upgrade for commercial buildings
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 3: Decorative & Branded Film — image LEFT, text RIGHT -->
        <div class="of-row">
          <div class="of-row__image">
            <img
              src="/images/re-decorative.jpg"
              alt="Decorative branded window film on Philadelphia retail storefront glass"
              width="680" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="of-row__text">
            <div class="of-row__eyebrow">Benefit 03</div>
            <h3 class="of-row__title">Turn Your Glass Into a Branding and Privacy Asset</h3>
            <p class="of-row__body">Your storefront glass is valuable real estate. <a href="/benefits/decorative-promotional/" style="color: #2E7D32; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #4CAF50; text-underline-offset: 3px;">Decorative window film</a> lets you put your brand identity directly on glass — frosted patterns, custom printed graphics, seasonal artwork, and privacy treatments that look like etched or sandblasted glass at a fraction of the cost. For Philadelphia boutiques, galleries, and specialty retailers, it's one of the most visually impactful upgrades available without touching the underlying glass.</p>
            <p class="of-row__body">Beyond branding, <a href="/benefits/privacy-window-film-philadelphia/" style="color: #2E7D32; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #4CAF50; text-underline-offset: 3px;">privacy film</a> solves practical problems: fitting room glass doors, back-of-house visibility, and street-level windows in health, beauty, or wellness retail categories. All decorative films are fully removable — no permanent alteration to the glass, no landlord conflict, and no cost to restore when your lease ends or your brand evolves.</p>
            <ul class="of-row__bullets">
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Custom frosted, printed, and patterned film for storefronts and interiors
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Fitting room privacy · branded storefronts · interior partitions
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Fully removable — no glass damage, no lease conflict
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Row 4: Security Film — text LEFT, image RIGHT -->
        <div class="of-row of-row--rev">
          <div class="of-row__image">
            <img
              src="/images/re-security.jpg"
              alt="Security window film protecting Philadelphia retail jewelry store from smash-and-grab"
              width="680" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="of-row__text">
            <div class="of-row__eyebrow">Benefit 04</div>
            <h3 class="of-row__title">Smash-and-Grab Protection That Works Before Police Arrive</h3>
            <p class="of-row__body">Standard retail glass shatters in seconds. <a href="/benefits/safety-and-security/" style="color: #2E7D32; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #4CAF50; text-underline-offset: 3px;">Security window film</a> bonds to the glass and holds the pane together on impact — significantly slowing forced entry and deterring opportunistic thieves who rely on speed. For Philadelphia jewelers, boutiques, electronics retailers, and any storefront with high-value visible inventory, this is a critical layer of protection.</p>
            <p class="of-row__body">Security film doesn't just slow intruders — it also protects occupants from flying glass shards during accidental breakage and severe weather. It's a single installation that addresses multiple risk categories, and it works invisibly 24/7 without alarms, cameras, or monitoring contracts.</p>
            <ul class="of-row__bullets">
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Holds glass together on impact · Deters smash-and-grab entry attempts
              </li>
              <li>
                <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" stroke="#7CB342" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                Protects against accidental breakage and severe weather
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

